# Rust compute

- Owns detect, mask, correspondence store, admin, stats.
- Put to Redis **before** 200 on new mask. Demask/lookup skips detect semaphore.
- Partial etalon-style masks on hot path; FPE/synthetic after must.
- Logs/metrics: types and offsets only — never PII values.
- No comments in code. `cargo clippy -- -D warnings` + `cargo fmt --check`.
- Respect track globs (detect / mask / store). See `docs/agents/OWNERSHIP.md`.
